  "about": "Hand labels for the recorded Taskly bundles beside this file. For the September runs, detected, falseAssurance and the clean arm's empty sets come from the dated results file named in each source, scored by hand when the runs were made. The two 2026-10-04 runs and their analyses were scored by hand in an evaluation review that day. supportedPlanted names a planted-class claim the clean build's evidence supports (the 120-character add box). d2Mechanism is the rubric author's reading of each report, assigned on 2026-10-04: a regression check on the rubric, with no independent rater. The four neutral-mission runs of the same day are the first live benchmark; the rubric author labelled them after reading each report and analysis, and three patterns were added on reading them (Enter leaving an edit open, lost-on-reload phrasings, a hedged D2 mechanism), so they check for regressions and do not validate the rubric.",
